cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "Detection gaps in the pilot-controller system: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for a four-decade analysis of 30,410 ATC-related NASA ASRS
  incident reports (1988-2026). Recovers hazard themes from reporter narratives
  with BERTopic, validates them against NASA-analyst labels, and links them to
  operational conditions, proportional trends, and the detection pathways
  recorded in the Detector, When Detected, and Result fields.
type: software
